<title>UK: BankAmerica sets $500 mln five-year FRN.</title>
<headline>BankAmerica sets $500 mln five-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers PaineWebber and Lehman Brothers.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANKAMERICA CORP</p>
<p> AMT    $500 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY  **20.FEB.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +6.25 BP  PAY DATE    20.FEB.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A1	  ISS PRICE  99.9045   FULL FEES   =</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A+	  REOFFER    99.9045</p>
<p> NOTES	**CALLABLE AT PAR FROM FEB.00</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    CALIF     HOME CTRY  U.S	 TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
